   :attestation "futon3c/holes/missions/M-transport-adapters.md:46 (R9) and exit condition :485 (delivery receipts as JSON frames); src/futon3c/transport/ws.clj:15,:22"
   :span-note "Content line only at futon3 pin ab277bdd: marker :18, content :19."}
